WEBVTT

01:35.820 --> 01:40.740
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.539 --> 01:43.960
[Episode 2]

01:52.680 --> 01:54.990
[Life Revived at a Single Touch]

01:59.430 --> 02:02.200
Why is Fu Yixiao here?

02:03.710 --> 02:05.280
A few days ago,
I went into the mountains to gather herbs.

02:05.280 --> 02:06.170
On the way, I encountered some bad people.

02:06.170 --> 02:07.140
She saved me.

02:07.050 --> 02:09.940
[Exquisite Mastery of Medicine]

02:07.590 --> 02:09.190
But she was badly injured at the time.

02:09.190 --> 02:10.000
So then,

02:10.120 --> 02:11.580
I brought her back with me.

02:11.870 --> 02:12.800
Which mountain?

02:13.280 --> 02:14.540
Head west out the gate.

02:14.750 --> 02:15.520
It was...

02:17.870 --> 02:19.910
Tian... Tiangeng Mountain.

02:20.000 --> 02:20.710
Yes.

02:24.430 --> 02:25.190
Your Highness,

02:25.190 --> 02:26.520
I have a small request.

02:26.630 --> 02:28.000
Miss Yixiao's
hand injury has not yet healed,

02:28.000 --> 02:29.310
and now she's also suffering from amnesia.

02:29.310 --> 02:30.030
May we keep her

02:30.030 --> 02:30.840
at Zhengnian Villa to recover...

02:30.840 --> 02:31.710
My Lady.

02:36.590 --> 02:38.920
It's not worth wasting valuable medicine

02:39.150 --> 02:41.360
on someone who's already dying.

02:46.940 --> 02:49.280
[Exquisite Mastery of Medicine]

03:08.750 --> 03:09.310
Yun Fang,

03:09.680 --> 03:11.610
come with me to Tiangeng Mountain.

03:21.470 --> 03:22.730
My Lady, you're right.

03:23.120 --> 03:23.680
She's actually

03:23.680 --> 03:25.540
the Red-Clad General, Fu Yixiao.

03:26.190 --> 03:27.190
In the Battle of Pingling,

03:27.190 --> 03:28.150
Susha's crushing defeat

03:28.150 --> 03:29.410
was all because of her.

03:29.710 --> 03:30.630
Feng Suige definitely

03:30.630 --> 03:31.960
won't let her go easily.

03:32.280 --> 03:33.280
It's all my fault.

03:33.520 --> 03:34.750
If it weren't for me,

03:34.960 --> 03:35.680
she wouldn't have ended up like this,

03:35.680 --> 03:36.430
captured without a fight

03:36.430 --> 03:37.910
and taken away by Feng Suige.

03:37.910 --> 03:38.870
My Lady,

03:39.120 --> 03:40.280
our Zhengnian Villa

03:40.470 --> 03:42.310
never gets involved
in matters between nations.

03:42.310 --> 03:45.150
We absolutely cannot meddle in this.

03:45.960 --> 03:47.160
We cannot intervene.

03:48.530 --> 03:52.680
[Prime Minister Zhuang's Mansion
in Susha Kingdom]

04:10.360 --> 04:11.150
Jingheng.

04:10.980 --> 04:13.340
[Tablets of
Prime Minister Zhuang's Ancestors]

04:13.080 --> 04:14.910
I failed you.

04:15.360 --> 04:16.269
I couldn't even

04:16.269 --> 04:18.730
place a memorial tablet
in your name openly.

04:27.540 --> 04:30.290
[Zhuang Shen,
Prime Minister of Susha Kingdom]

04:27.720 --> 04:28.850
Where have you been?

04:29.800 --> 04:30.680
Why are you back so late?

04:30.490 --> 04:32.300
[Zhuang He, Foster Son of Zhuang Shen]

04:31.430 --> 04:32.470
Coming from Zuixian Pavilion,

04:32.470 --> 04:33.870
or from Yipin Residence?

04:34.680 --> 04:35.970
[Zhuang Ming,
Vice Minister of Justice of Susha Kingdom]

04:36.159 --> 04:36.920
Godfather,

04:37.430 --> 04:38.950
I admit I was wrong.

04:41.430 --> 04:43.040
At your age,

04:43.240 --> 04:44.720
Jingheng was already a General of Cavalry,

04:44.720 --> 04:45.720
leading troops

04:45.750 --> 04:47.750
to expand Susha's territory for me.

04:48.800 --> 04:49.750
And you...

04:53.800 --> 04:54.510
Forget it.

04:55.240 --> 04:56.560
Living mediocre lives

04:57.000 --> 04:58.930
may not be such a bad fate after all.

05:01.050 --> 05:03.590
[Tablets of
Prime Minister Zhuang's Ancestors]

05:12.490 --> 05:14.630
[Ancestral Virtue and Familial Merit]

05:17.830 --> 05:19.430
You know Uncle cares about Jingheng.

05:19.430 --> 05:20.630
So why showed up late?

05:20.920 --> 05:22.680
I was just happy yesterday,

05:22.950 --> 05:24.350
had a few drinks too many.

05:26.600 --> 05:28.600
Although Feng Suige's
carriage went off the cliff,

05:28.600 --> 05:29.120
you still haven't

05:29.120 --> 05:30.190
found his body.

05:30.720 --> 05:32.180
Don't celebrate too soon.

05:32.600 --> 05:33.310
Ming,

05:33.390 --> 05:35.630
that cliff is over 300 meters deep.

05:36.920 --> 05:38.450
There's no way he survived.

05:38.830 --> 05:40.720
Uncle doesn't know

05:40.870 --> 05:42.270
you sent someone
to assassinate Feng Suige.

05:42.270 --> 05:43.430
If it were up to him,

05:43.750 --> 05:45.390
he would never have allowed you

05:45.390 --> 05:46.590
to act so recklessly.

05:47.310 --> 05:49.040
Thank you for covering for me.

05:49.310 --> 05:50.750
I believe in just a few days,

05:50.750 --> 05:52.120
news of Feng Suige's death

05:52.120 --> 05:53.560
will reach Yujing.

05:53.630 --> 05:54.430
Then,

05:55.630 --> 05:56.680
Godfather will finally look at me

05:56.680 --> 05:57.720
with new eyes.

05:58.480 --> 06:00.000
Once Feng Suige is dead,

06:00.270 --> 06:00.870
Susha

06:01.190 --> 06:01.920
will surely

06:01.950 --> 06:03.550
belong to the Zhuang family.

06:08.190 --> 06:09.090
[I, your servant Liu Qin,
Vice Minister of War,]

06:09.090 --> 06:09.990
[kneel to submit this memorial.]

06:10.430 --> 06:13.040
This article is full of flowery rhetoric,

06:13.680 --> 06:15.080
not a single useful word.

06:16.750 --> 06:18.600
Your Majesty, please calm your anger.

06:18.600 --> 06:20.000
Even before the Battle of Pingling,

06:20.000 --> 06:21.120
those ministers pushing for peace

06:21.120 --> 06:22.720
already opposed
your decision to go to war.

06:22.720 --> 06:23.950
Now that we've lost the battle,

06:23.950 --> 06:24.800
it's only natural

06:24.800 --> 06:25.950
that they're grumbling

06:25.950 --> 06:27.150
openly and in secret.

06:27.680 --> 06:29.810
The ones who should speak stay silent,

06:30.070 --> 06:32.750
and those who shouldn't
step right into the spotlight.

06:32.750 --> 06:34.070
Even I find it odd.

06:34.720 --> 06:35.870
Since the news of the defeat at Pingling

06:35.870 --> 06:37.000
has been transmitted back until now.

06:37.000 --> 06:38.270
Prime Minister Zhuang

06:38.270 --> 06:39.480
hasn't said a word
against the First Prince.

06:39.480 --> 06:40.240
In the past,

06:40.360 --> 06:41.020
he would've

06:41.040 --> 06:41.950
rallied other ministers

06:41.950 --> 06:42.870
to find ways

06:42.870 --> 06:44.920
to strip the First Prince
of his military power.

06:44.920 --> 06:45.680
What's more,

06:45.830 --> 06:47.720
the Second Prince is about to come of age.

06:47.720 --> 06:48.920
This is a golden

06:48.920 --> 06:49.800
opportunity.

06:54.310 --> 06:56.640
Forgive me for speaking out of turn again.

06:59.040 --> 06:59.840
Your Majesty!

06:59.950 --> 07:02.150
Urgent report from the Feng Battalion!

07:08.070 --> 07:08.870
Your Majesty.

07:14.950 --> 07:15.480
Bad news.

07:15.600 --> 07:16.510
The First Prince was ambushed

07:16.510 --> 07:17.240
and fell off a cliff.

07:17.240 --> 07:18.310
His condition is unknown.

07:18.310 --> 07:19.110
Your Majesty.

07:19.160 --> 07:21.360
Shall we send someone to search for him?

07:21.510 --> 07:22.950
If he can't survive

07:22.950 --> 07:24.000
this trial,

07:26.750 --> 07:29.390
then he doesn't deserve to be my son.

07:28.630 --> 07:31.600
[That's why we lost the battle.]

07:41.950 --> 07:42.800
Fu...

07:43.800 --> 07:44.680
Yi...

07:45.720 --> 07:46.750
Xiao...

07:49.159 --> 07:50.000
There are indeed signs

07:50.000 --> 07:51.400
of a fight in that forest.

07:51.630 --> 07:52.720
But most of the traces

07:52.720 --> 07:53.750
have been erased.

07:55.270 --> 07:56.600
Erased?

08:01.680 --> 08:04.000
It seems someone wanted to cover it up.

08:04.560 --> 08:06.870
However, we did find
a corpse by the river.

08:06.870 --> 08:09.130
We recovered a waist token from the body.

08:16.000 --> 08:17.680
Judging from its design and material,

08:17.680 --> 08:19.340
it clearly belongs to Jinxiu.

08:19.360 --> 08:20.120
Besides that,

08:20.120 --> 08:21.240
I also discovered signs below the cliff

08:21.240 --> 08:23.370
that someone had fallen from a height.

08:25.480 --> 08:26.920
She was likely shot with an arrow first,

08:25.740 --> 08:27.220
[Life Revived at a Single Touch]

08:27.350 --> 08:28.560
then fell from above.

08:29.160 --> 08:29.950
Amnesia

08:30.510 --> 08:31.840
was due to a head injury.

08:39.030 --> 08:41.000
So she was shot

08:41.000 --> 08:42.360
and fell off the cliff,

08:42.960 --> 08:45.490
miraculously survived,
but lost her memory.

08:46.030 --> 08:48.000
Then she ran into a group of assassins

08:48.000 --> 08:50.240
who tried to kill her.

08:50.320 --> 08:52.240
That's what the evidence suggests.

08:52.240 --> 08:52.790
But I...

08:53.150 --> 08:54.670
I feel something doesn't add up.

08:54.670 --> 08:55.930
It doesn't make sense.

08:56.080 --> 08:57.270
Fu Yixiao earned great merit

08:57.270 --> 08:58.120
in the Battle of Pingling.

08:58.120 --> 08:59.120
She's also a close aide

08:59.120 --> 09:00.440
of Prince of Zhennan, Xia Jingshi.

09:00.440 --> 09:01.510
The Three Heroes of Jinxiu

09:01.510 --> 09:02.000
are her,

09:02.120 --> 09:03.120
Ning Fei, and Xiao Weiran.

09:03.120 --> 09:04.320
They're held in high esteem in the army.

09:04.320 --> 09:05.080
Exactly.

09:05.320 --> 09:06.870
Within Zhennan Pass of Jinxiu,

09:06.870 --> 09:09.240
who would dare to lay a hand on her?

09:15.440 --> 09:17.960
[Prince Zhennan's Mansion
in Jinxiu Kingdom]

09:32.870 --> 09:34.400
This belonged to my mother.

09:35.600 --> 09:37.390
With it as my betrothal gift,
witnessed by Heaven and Earth,

09:37.390 --> 09:38.840
with the mountains
and rivers as our matchmaker,

09:38.840 --> 09:40.840
I vow to stay by your side till death.

09:41.360 --> 09:42.270
Will you marry me

09:42.270 --> 09:44.600
in the phoenix crown and red bridal dress?

09:44.910 --> 09:46.670
After the Battle of Pingling,

09:47.440 --> 09:49.320
once I return with military honors,

09:49.320 --> 09:50.390
give it to me then.

09:54.240 --> 09:55.300
I'll listen to you.

10:56.870 --> 10:59.840
You all bear a blood feud.

10:59.840 --> 11:01.360
You have no family, no ties.

11:01.360 --> 11:01.960
Your lives

11:02.200 --> 11:03.600
are worth less than dirt.

11:06.030 --> 11:07.790
If you wish to survive here,

11:09.030 --> 11:10.360
you must become

11:10.360 --> 11:11.960
the bravest death warriors.

11:41.510 --> 11:42.440
Don't be afraid.

11:42.960 --> 11:44.020
It's all right now.

11:44.910 --> 11:45.720
I, Fu Yixiao,

11:46.000 --> 11:47.910
from this day on, join the Zhennan Army.

11:46.520 --> 11:47.670
[Nan]

11:48.200 --> 11:49.870
I swear loyalty
unto death to His Highness.

11:49.870 --> 11:51.480
I shall tear apart those

11:51.630 --> 11:53.720
who kill the people of Jinxiu,
and drink their blood.

11:53.720 --> 11:56.320
I shall execute those who slay
even one soldier of the Zhennan Army

11:56.320 --> 11:57.240
without mercy!

12:01.240 --> 12:03.550
Kill! Kill!

12:56.390 --> 12:58.440
That's not how you looked before.

12:59.720 --> 13:01.050
Though there was anger,

13:01.440 --> 13:02.200
resentment,

13:02.870 --> 13:05.480
your eyes held
more confusion than anything else.

13:05.480 --> 13:06.910
Looks like you've remembered

13:06.910 --> 13:07.750
who you are.

13:12.150 --> 13:14.750
You earned great merit
in the Battle of Pingling,

13:14.750 --> 13:16.000
yet as a hero of Jinxiu,

13:16.000 --> 13:17.390
you ended up like this.

13:17.600 --> 13:19.860
What happened to you wasn't an accident.

13:20.960 --> 13:23.200
Someone in Jinxiu wants you dead.

13:23.960 --> 13:26.030
Who is it, and why?

13:31.200 --> 13:32.670
Do you truly not remember,

13:33.960 --> 13:35.910
or are you just unwilling to say?

13:41.080 --> 13:42.030
Fu Yixiao,

13:42.630 --> 13:44.390
tell me everything you know.

13:46.240 --> 13:47.360
That's the only reason

13:47.360 --> 13:48.720
I've spared your life.

13:58.510 --> 13:59.910
Since you put it that way,

14:01.320 --> 14:02.630
I do recall

14:02.670 --> 14:03.600
something else.

14:03.750 --> 14:04.720
Speak.

14:05.720 --> 14:09.080
47.

14:10.870 --> 14:11.630
What?

14:12.120 --> 14:13.390
I'll take it back.

14:27.840 --> 14:29.080
You want to die?

14:29.480 --> 14:30.270
Let go of His Highness!

14:30.270 --> 14:31.080
Your Highness!

14:31.080 --> 14:31.940
Your Highness!

15:04.670 --> 15:05.510
Kill her!

15:05.750 --> 15:07.270
Avenge our fallen brothers!

15:07.270 --> 15:08.030
Stop!

15:09.870 --> 15:10.320
Your Highness!

15:10.320 --> 15:12.390
I said keep her alive!

15:18.080 --> 15:19.270
The Battle of Pingling

15:19.270 --> 15:21.440
was far more complicated than you think.

15:21.440 --> 15:22.840
She may be the only one

15:22.910 --> 15:25.040
who can unravel the mystery behind it.

15:25.270 --> 15:26.550
And that mystery

15:26.790 --> 15:28.790
concerns not only her life or death,

15:30.150 --> 15:32.630
but ours as well.

15:39.580 --> 15:40.850
[Prince Zhennan's Mansion]

15:41.510 --> 15:44.240
Prince of Zhennan,
receive the imperial decree.

15:48.150 --> 15:51.150
By the mandate of Heaven,
His Majesty of Jinxiu

15:51.240 --> 15:52.320
declares:

15:52.510 --> 15:54.640
Out of care for the people of the world,

15:54.720 --> 15:56.030
I cannot bear to see the common folk

15:56.030 --> 15:57.630
suffer further from war.

15:57.870 --> 15:58.360
Therefore,

15:58.360 --> 16:01.120
I have decided
to end the war with Susha Kingdom

16:01.320 --> 16:03.440
and establish lasting diplomatic ties.

16:03.440 --> 16:04.840
I hereby bestow a marriage alliance

16:04.840 --> 16:06.840
between Prince Zhennan
and the Princess of Susha.

16:06.840 --> 16:09.360
For the sake of the state above,
and the people below,

16:09.360 --> 16:12.390
this act reflects the curbing of my
paternal love and serves the greater good.

16:12.390 --> 16:13.790
Thus decreed.

16:20.360 --> 16:21.220
Your Highness.

16:21.870 --> 16:24.630
Your Highness, you're not thinking of
defying the imperial decree, are you?

16:24.630 --> 16:25.490
Your Highness.

16:29.510 --> 16:31.710
I thank His Majesty for his great grace.

17:06.270 --> 17:07.670
Don't waste your energy.

17:07.880 --> 17:09.160
You might faint again from the pain.

17:09.160 --> 17:10.760
So I gave you some decoction.

17:11.030 --> 17:12.480
The numbness and weakness you feel

17:12.480 --> 17:13.880
are just from the medicine.

17:13.880 --> 17:14.829
You won't die.

17:16.109 --> 17:17.510
What exactly do you want?

17:18.160 --> 17:19.960
To dress your wounds, of course.

17:20.030 --> 17:20.829
Otherwise,

17:22.109 --> 17:23.569
you'll be left with scars.

17:24.880 --> 17:26.680
If you want to kill me, just do it.

17:27.000 --> 17:28.160
Why humiliate me?

17:30.720 --> 17:32.920
I've never had a maid with me in the army.

17:33.030 --> 17:34.270
So if anyone's dressing your wounds,

17:34.270 --> 17:35.720
it'll have to be me.

17:36.680 --> 17:38.410
Shall I blindfold myself then?

17:38.920 --> 17:40.380
But if I blindfold myself,

17:40.720 --> 17:42.350
how can I help you properly?

17:43.200 --> 17:45.070
As a seasoned officer, Commander Fu,

17:45.070 --> 17:46.480
surely you're not

17:46.830 --> 17:48.560
overly bothered by propriety.

17:50.110 --> 17:51.510
You might as well kill me.

17:53.920 --> 17:54.880
If I were you,

17:55.240 --> 17:56.200
in such a situation,

17:56.200 --> 17:58.000
I wouldn't seek death so easily.

17:58.070 --> 17:59.000
After all, death

17:59.440 --> 18:01.310
is far too simple.

18:02.640 --> 18:04.550
Heaven has given you a second chance.

18:04.550 --> 18:06.310
You should treasure it.

18:09.510 --> 18:11.070
Better to just kill me.

18:13.200 --> 18:14.930
Don't think that by sparing me,

18:15.720 --> 18:17.480
I'll feel grateful.

18:22.400 --> 18:23.600
It took great resolve

18:23.790 --> 18:25.750
not to kill you.

18:26.640 --> 18:27.590
I didn't spare you

18:27.590 --> 18:28.920
to earn your gratitude.

18:32.400 --> 18:34.510
If you've got the strength,
then take a guess why.

18:34.510 --> 18:36.370
There's a reward if you're right.

18:47.070 --> 18:48.590
Has His Highness

18:49.030 --> 18:50.440
ever personally dressed
anyone's wounds before?

18:50.340 --> 18:52.260
[Yun Fang, of the Feng Battalion
in Susha Kingdom]

18:51.200 --> 18:52.200
Never.

18:52.480 --> 18:54.880
So he never intended to kill her.

18:55.160 --> 18:56.480
Then why hit her so hard?

18:56.480 --> 18:57.480
How should I know?

18:57.720 --> 18:59.320
To avenge that arrow, maybe?

18:59.590 --> 19:01.190
A bit petty, don't you think?

19:01.440 --> 19:03.000
How dare you judge His Highness?

19:03.000 --> 19:04.200
His Highness's not usually

19:04.200 --> 19:05.550
so small-minded.

19:05.880 --> 19:07.550
That's what I'm curious about.

19:07.550 --> 19:09.480
Wait, what are you saying exactly?

19:09.830 --> 19:11.230
Do you have nothing to do?

19:11.350 --> 19:12.880
Why are you eavesdropping?

19:13.070 --> 19:13.720
I...

19:23.350 --> 19:24.720
Feng Suige didn't die.

19:25.000 --> 19:25.680
But my men

19:25.680 --> 19:27.030
saw with their own eyes

19:27.110 --> 19:28.790
his carriage fall off the cliff.

19:28.790 --> 19:30.000
How could he be alive?

19:30.160 --> 19:31.480
Feng Suige is cunning and elusive.

19:31.480 --> 19:32.940
He wouldn't die so easily.

19:34.240 --> 19:35.880
Even if he survived, so what?

19:36.070 --> 19:36.920
He doesn't know

19:36.920 --> 19:38.120
I sent the assassins.

19:38.350 --> 19:39.510
Even if he suspects it,

19:39.510 --> 19:40.440
without evidence,

19:40.440 --> 19:41.960
what could he do to me?

19:42.110 --> 19:43.920
He's Feng Suige, the Killer God.

19:44.000 --> 19:46.200
When has he ever needed a reason to kill?

19:48.510 --> 19:49.920
I can't sit and wait.

19:50.510 --> 19:52.200
Ming, you must help me.

19:59.070 --> 19:59.830
Right now,

20:01.110 --> 20:03.160
you've got no choice but to strike first.

20:03.160 --> 20:04.420
What do you mean, Ming?

20:04.880 --> 20:06.110
Before he comes for you,

20:06.110 --> 20:07.400
you go after him.

20:07.720 --> 20:08.780
He lost the battle.

20:09.160 --> 20:10.890
Someone has to answer for that.

20:11.110 --> 20:11.790
We may not be able

20:11.790 --> 20:13.160
to touch Feng Suige,

20:13.440 --> 20:14.510
but his officers,

20:14.680 --> 20:15.720
his Feng Battalion,

20:15.720 --> 20:17.680
must pay for the defeat.

20:18.960 --> 20:19.790
In the Battle of Pingling,

20:19.790 --> 20:21.550
they'd already broken
through Zhennan Pass,

20:21.550 --> 20:23.480
yet they returned in utter defeat.

20:23.920 --> 20:25.000
His Majesty won't let it go,

20:25.000 --> 20:27.000
and the court won't let it go either.

20:27.680 --> 20:29.610
Someone must be held accountable.

20:29.920 --> 20:31.380
There must be a scapegoat.

20:31.720 --> 20:33.920
As long as members of the Feng Battalion

20:34.110 --> 20:35.350
fall into my hands,

20:35.720 --> 20:37.780
guilty or not, I can make them guilty.

20:39.000 --> 20:40.460
If he wants to save his men,

20:40.790 --> 20:43.320
he'll have no choice
but to back down. Then...

20:44.720 --> 20:46.050
The crisis is resolved.

20:46.590 --> 20:48.070
Brilliant, Ming!

20:48.750 --> 20:50.310
I'll make him beg me

20:50.480 --> 20:51.210
on his knees.

21:00.170 --> 21:05.030
[Post Station]

21:01.000 --> 21:01.860
Your Highness,

21:02.310 --> 21:03.370
what are your plans

21:03.680 --> 21:04.590
for Fu Yixiao?

21:07.550 --> 21:08.680
We set out tomorrow.

21:09.200 --> 21:11.200
She's coming with us to the capital.

21:13.030 --> 21:13.720
Your Highness,

21:13.720 --> 21:15.440
we're not returning to Qingye Camp?

21:15.440 --> 21:16.680
His Majesty hasn't summoned you.

21:16.680 --> 21:18.270
There's no need to rush back.

21:18.270 --> 21:18.750
I just think

21:18.750 --> 21:19.920
if we go back now,

21:20.030 --> 21:20.640
some people will surely

21:20.640 --> 21:21.510
make a big fuss

21:21.510 --> 21:22.920
about the Battle of Pingling.

21:22.920 --> 21:23.480
This...

21:24.640 --> 21:25.270
You forgot what day

21:25.270 --> 21:26.550
the fifth is, didn't you?

21:26.550 --> 21:27.640
Still so careless.

21:29.750 --> 21:31.160
I... I've been so busy

21:31.510 --> 21:32.880
that I lost track of things.

21:32.880 --> 21:34.200
Quickly compile
the list of fallen soldiers

21:34.200 --> 21:35.800
from the Battle of Pingling.

21:36.480 --> 21:37.830
Our brothers died for the nation,

21:37.830 --> 21:39.090
wrapped in horsehide.

21:39.480 --> 21:42.080
We must not
let their families feel abandoned.

21:42.310 --> 21:43.070
Gather the rations and pay.

21:43.070 --> 21:45.200
Distribute them household by household.

21:45.200 --> 21:46.510
The elderly, women, and children

21:46.510 --> 21:48.160
who can't fend for themselves

21:48.160 --> 21:49.160
must be cared for

21:50.070 --> 21:51.600
and given shelter and food.

21:51.720 --> 21:52.920
Rest assured, Your Highness.

21:52.920 --> 21:54.450
I'll handle it personally.

22:03.350 --> 22:05.720
[Susha]

22:32.750 --> 22:33.960
If I were you,

22:34.240 --> 22:35.720
I wouldn't act rashly.

22:36.750 --> 22:37.960
You've lost your memory
and you're severely injured.

22:37.960 --> 22:39.240
You're no better than a cripple.

22:39.240 --> 22:40.070
If you resist,

22:40.070 --> 22:41.600
you'll only hurt yourself.

22:41.960 --> 22:43.790
I didn't spare you out of kindness.

22:43.790 --> 22:46.190
I simply hope you'll surrender willingly.

22:46.640 --> 22:47.790
Enough nonsense.

22:53.000 --> 22:54.480
I wasn't the one who shot you

22:54.480 --> 22:55.340
off that cliff.

22:55.440 --> 22:56.550
Nor did I send anyone

22:56.550 --> 22:57.350
to kill you.

22:57.720 --> 22:58.920
Though you and I
come from different nations,

22:58.920 --> 22:59.880
and our hatred runs deep as the sea,

22:59.880 --> 23:00.550
right now, there is someone

23:00.550 --> 23:02.610
who wants you dead even more than I do.

23:04.830 --> 23:06.110
That you ended up in my hands

23:06.110 --> 23:07.790
may be the will of Heaven.

23:08.240 --> 23:10.480
I hope you'll
turn back before it's too late.

23:10.480 --> 23:12.030
But if you remain stubborn

23:12.030 --> 23:13.240
and seek death with all your heart,

23:13.240 --> 23:15.040
I won't hesitate to use your life

23:15.510 --> 23:17.110
to honor the countless soldiers

23:17.110 --> 23:19.040
who died in the Battle of Pingling.

23:20.640 --> 23:22.880
Your life and death
are no longer up to me.

23:22.880 --> 23:25.030
They hinge on your own choice.

23:33.270 --> 23:34.240
Feng Suige,

23:34.750 --> 23:36.410
I won't let you manipulate me.

23:36.790 --> 23:38.590
Don't even think about using me.

23:49.960 --> 23:51.030
Report!

23:51.880 --> 23:52.640
Halt.

23:58.270 --> 23:59.130
Your Highness,

23:59.160 --> 24:00.760
the scouts ahead report that

24:00.920 --> 24:02.000
His Majesty is hosting
the coming-of-age ceremony

24:02.000 --> 24:02.640
for the Second Prince

24:02.640 --> 24:04.300
along with all the ministers.

24:04.510 --> 24:06.270
Shall we return to the residence first

24:06.270 --> 24:08.000
or head straight to the palace?

24:11.920 --> 24:12.880
To the palace.

24:17.550 --> 24:18.680
Yes, Your Highness.

24:25.510 --> 24:29.030
[Susha]

24:28.240 --> 24:29.880
Those damn Zhuangs.

24:30.310 --> 24:31.720
Why did they have to
choose today for the ceremony?

24:31.720 --> 24:32.270
Lu Ke!

24:32.790 --> 24:33.510
What is it?

24:33.750 --> 24:35.680
I'm not afraid of being overheard.

24:40.600 --> 24:42.630
[Palace of Susha Kingdom]

25:00.440 --> 25:02.100
Let the Prince take his place.

25:05.270 --> 25:07.270
Let the ewer be presented for washing.

25:07.270 --> 25:10.930
Let the black cloth cap be set
upon his head for the first crowning.

25:12.120 --> 25:17.560
[Feng Chengyang,
Second Prince of Susha Kingdom]

25:14.030 --> 25:15.720
On an auspicious day of a blessed month,

25:15.720 --> 25:17.580
you begin to wear your adult robe.

25:17.790 --> 25:19.120
Abandon childish ways,

25:19.310 --> 25:21.000
follow the path of virtue,

25:21.790 --> 25:23.480
live long and well,

25:23.790 --> 25:25.790
and receive Heaven's blessings.

25:36.680 --> 25:38.610
Next, the leather cap is bestowed.

25:39.110 --> 25:40.480
On this auspicious day,

25:40.750 --> 25:42.350
your fortune is reaffirmed.

25:42.680 --> 25:44.480
Respectful in manner,

25:44.790 --> 25:46.510
refined in virtue,

25:46.830 --> 25:48.690
may you live a long and noble life,

25:48.790 --> 25:50.880
and enjoy blessings forever.

25:51.830 --> 25:54.090
Third, the cap of nobility is conferred.

25:54.350 --> 25:56.160
According to proper season and month,

25:56.160 --> 25:57.680
your full adult garments

25:57.960 --> 25:59.590
are donned.

26:00.400 --> 26:01.930
With brothers at your side,

26:02.110 --> 26:04.000
may your virtue be complete.

26:05.070 --> 26:06.530
May your days be unending,

26:06.680 --> 26:09.070
and Heaven grant you honor.

26:13.750 --> 26:15.310
The rite is complete!

26:16.400 --> 26:18.260
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

26:18.350 --> 26:20.550
Congratulations to the Second Prince.

26:21.270 --> 26:22.110
Rise.

26:25.030 --> 26:26.360
Let me take a look at you.

26:39.590 --> 26:42.270
We welcome the First Prince
back to the capital.

26:42.790 --> 26:44.390
The First Prince has spoken:

26:44.880 --> 26:46.160
no need for formalities.

26:46.160 --> 26:47.070
Make way.

26:47.400 --> 26:48.440
Today,

26:48.960 --> 26:50.750
I'm afraid I can't give way.

26:51.240 --> 26:52.750
Until the truth is uncovered,

26:52.750 --> 26:54.550
no one may enter the city.

27:00.400 --> 27:01.330
What did you say?

27:02.110 --> 27:03.480
In the Battle of Pingling,

27:03.480 --> 27:05.830
Susha was on the verge of victory,

27:06.110 --> 27:08.000
but suddenly suffered
a strange and total defeat.

27:08.000 --> 27:10.400
The First Prince was even gravely wounded.

27:10.790 --> 27:11.550
Since the age

27:11.550 --> 27:13.240
of 18

27:13.550 --> 27:14.590
he's never lost a battle.

27:14.590 --> 27:16.160
He's Susha's Killer God.

27:16.590 --> 27:18.720
This sudden turn from victory to defeat

27:18.720 --> 27:19.980
is highly suspicious.

27:20.160 --> 27:21.640
We cannot help but suspect

27:21.720 --> 27:23.240
there is a traitor

27:23.750 --> 27:25.550
among the First Prince's ranks.

27:29.000 --> 27:29.730
How dare you!

27:30.880 --> 27:31.480
It seems

27:31.510 --> 27:32.750
that you, the First Prince of Susha,

27:32.750 --> 27:34.080
aren't faring too well.

27:34.440 --> 27:36.000
Imperial Guards, where are you?

27:36.000 --> 27:36.550
Here!

27:36.830 --> 27:38.160
Arrest the members of the Feng Battalion.

27:38.160 --> 27:38.920
Yes!

27:40.000 --> 27:40.830
Who dares?

27:53.440 --> 27:55.200
By order of the Prime Minister,

27:55.510 --> 27:57.310
I am here to escort the Feng Battalion

27:57.310 --> 27:59.770
to the Ministry of Justice
for questioning.

28:09.510 --> 28:10.200
Mr. Ma.

28:10.440 --> 28:11.700
It's the First Prince.

28:11.960 --> 28:13.220
Understood. Go ahead.

28:15.920 --> 28:16.720
Your Majesty,

28:16.920 --> 28:17.960
the First Prince and the Feng Battalion

28:17.960 --> 28:19.020
have been stopped.

28:19.440 --> 28:21.030
If he can't even protect

28:21.030 --> 28:22.360
his own Feng Battalion,

28:22.830 --> 28:24.960
he'll be at the mercy
of others once he returns.

28:24.960 --> 28:25.720
Let it be.

28:30.350 --> 28:31.640
The Prime Minister's order

28:31.640 --> 28:33.480
is backed by the Empress's edict,

28:33.480 --> 28:35.610
and carries the intent of His Majesty.

28:35.680 --> 28:36.350
What now?

28:36.720 --> 28:39.580
Does the First Prince
intend to defy a royal decree?

28:40.000 --> 28:41.400
Watch your words.

28:41.830 --> 28:43.230
His Highness will surely

28:43.240 --> 28:45.040
explain himself to His Majesty.

28:48.830 --> 28:49.790
Move!

28:51.310 --> 28:53.310
You're just a lieutenant.

28:53.830 --> 28:55.290
How dare you block my path?

28:58.830 --> 29:00.590
If the First Prince won't hand them over,

29:00.590 --> 29:02.320
then he's defying the Emperor.

29:14.270 --> 29:15.920
I am Deputy Commander
of the Feng Battalion.

29:15.920 --> 29:18.050
I know every person in this battalion.

29:18.750 --> 29:19.550
Let me go alone

29:19.550 --> 29:21.080
to answer the questioning.

29:23.270 --> 29:24.440
You're out of your mind.

29:24.440 --> 29:25.350
It's all right.

29:25.830 --> 29:27.200
I'd like to hear

29:27.400 --> 29:28.750
what they want to ask.

29:29.350 --> 29:30.510
Ask questions?

29:30.830 --> 29:32.750
And after the questioning, will my men

29:32.750 --> 29:35.010
from the Feng Battalion
be able to leave?

29:39.590 --> 29:40.450
Commander Yun,

29:40.960 --> 29:41.960
this is too risky.

29:42.350 --> 29:43.610
Let me go in your place!

29:43.830 --> 29:45.640
Let me go! Let me go!

29:45.750 --> 29:46.830
Let me go!

29:46.920 --> 29:48.780
I'll go! I'll go! Please let me go!

29:48.830 --> 29:49.750
Please let me go!

29:49.750 --> 29:50.310
Let me go! Let me go!

29:50.310 --> 29:51.110
Everyone stop fighting.

29:51.110 --> 29:51.830
Let me go!

29:53.160 --> 29:53.790
I'll go.

29:55.830 --> 29:56.590
Mr. Cao.

30:00.550 --> 30:02.830
I joined the army at 20.

30:03.350 --> 30:04.510
First, I served His Majesty.

30:04.510 --> 30:05.070
Later,

30:05.240 --> 30:07.400
I joined
the First Prince's Feng Battalion.

30:07.400 --> 30:08.070
Within this unit,

30:08.070 --> 30:09.400
I know every person's background

30:09.400 --> 30:10.530
better than anyone.

30:11.070 --> 30:12.750
I've fought for 30 years.

30:13.270 --> 30:14.400
These old bones have

30:15.070 --> 30:16.400
visited the gates of the underworld

30:16.400 --> 30:18.070
more times than I can count.

30:18.640 --> 30:20.640
Going to the Ministry of Justice...

30:21.830 --> 30:23.890
Is easier than a trip to the outhouse.

30:26.200 --> 30:27.200
You young lads,

30:27.960 --> 30:29.090
either full of fire,

30:29.350 --> 30:30.720
or with families to care for,

30:30.720 --> 30:31.920
none of you fit the part of a traitor.

30:31.920 --> 30:32.920
Too complicated.

30:33.550 --> 30:34.790
But me, I'm alone,

30:35.000 --> 30:36.030
no family, no attachments.

30:36.030 --> 30:37.270
Most like a spy.

30:37.590 --> 30:38.350
So

30:39.030 --> 30:39.880
I'll go.

30:40.550 --> 30:41.510
Cao...

30:48.790 --> 30:50.440
Feng Battalion, hear my order!

30:50.440 --> 30:51.160
Yes!

30:51.920 --> 30:52.980
Remove your armor.

31:00.400 --> 31:01.960
Remove your armor!

31:02.270 --> 31:03.550
Yes!

31:27.590 --> 31:28.590
Veteran Cao Yuan

31:28.830 --> 31:30.200
followed His Majesty 30 years ago

31:30.200 --> 31:32.030
and led a thousand riders
to break into the Central Plains.

31:32.030 --> 31:32.880
He beheaded

31:32.920 --> 31:34.510
five Western scouts with his own hands.

31:34.510 --> 31:35.970
In the Battle of Pingling,

31:36.070 --> 31:36.750
he shielded me

31:36.750 --> 31:38.680
from a fatal blow during the siege.

31:39.030 --> 31:40.030
The wound on his neck,

31:40.030 --> 31:40.920
if half an inch closer,

31:40.920 --> 31:42.580
and his head would've rolled.

31:43.440 --> 31:44.920
Call him a traitor?

31:45.030 --> 31:46.230
Who would believe it?

31:46.270 --> 31:47.510
I don't!

31:49.720 --> 31:50.350
Hong Shan.

31:50.510 --> 31:51.000
Here!

31:53.680 --> 31:55.480
Six times as a vanguard

31:56.310 --> 31:57.170
death warrior,

31:57.790 --> 31:59.160
he personally planted the Phoenix flag

31:59.160 --> 32:00.400
on enemy walls.

32:01.160 --> 32:03.160
He was crushed by a 25-kilo boulder.

32:03.480 --> 32:04.550
To this day,

32:04.550 --> 32:05.680
his left ear is deaf.

32:06.480 --> 32:08.000
Say he's a traitor?

32:08.830 --> 32:09.830
Do you believe it?

32:11.590 --> 32:14.070
I don't believe it!

32:14.110 --> 32:17.160
I don't believe it!
I don't believe it!

32:17.310 --> 32:18.370
I don't believe it!

32:18.510 --> 32:19.770
What are you all doing?

32:20.510 --> 32:21.570
Are you rebelling?

32:22.030 --> 32:23.310
Take them all away!

32:30.640 --> 32:31.880
Lord Zhuang!

32:45.880 --> 32:47.540
Long time no see, Lord Zhuang.

32:49.310 --> 32:50.350
Your Highness!

32:50.960 --> 32:53.220
Are you defying an imperial order today?

32:53.270 --> 32:54.930
Let Lord Zhuang come forward.

32:55.000 --> 32:56.260
Speak with me up close.

32:56.830 --> 32:57.750
Step closer.

33:22.550 --> 33:23.720
Your Highness.

33:24.440 --> 33:26.700
I act under the Prime Minister's orders.

33:26.880 --> 33:27.640
Who?

33:30.510 --> 33:32.470
Come closer and say it.

33:41.270 --> 33:42.030
I said

33:42.110 --> 33:44.550
I act under the Prime Minister's orders.

33:50.400 --> 33:51.640
Choosing today...

33:51.920 --> 33:53.850
Well, that's just bad luck for you.

33:54.160 --> 33:55.200
What do you mean?

34:04.350 --> 34:06.200
A death anniversary deserves a sacrifice.

34:06.200 --> 34:06.920
You...

34:07.000 --> 34:08.510
Then be the offering

34:08.550 --> 34:10.070
for your godfather.

34:21.070 --> 34:22.110
Enter the city.

34:33.389 --> 34:35.960
[The streets of Yujing City,
Susha Kingdom]

34:45.920 --> 34:46.800
I admit,

34:46.800 --> 34:48.730
I was a bit harsh toward you before.

34:49.630 --> 34:50.630
Going forward, I hope

34:50.630 --> 34:52.400
we can interact in a new way.

34:53.030 --> 34:54.760
Return to my residence to rest.

34:54.920 --> 34:56.719
Once your injuries have healed,

34:56.920 --> 34:58.150
we can discuss in detail

34:58.150 --> 34:59.680
how we might work together.

35:01.320 --> 35:02.760
You want to work with me?

35:03.440 --> 35:04.440
Don't you want to know

35:04.440 --> 35:05.960
who shot you on the cliff

35:05.960 --> 35:07.290
and who wanted you dead?

35:08.230 --> 35:09.630
Back at Zhengnian Villa,

35:09.920 --> 35:11.850
you were quite curious about that.

35:19.440 --> 35:20.500
Lu Ke, come with me.

35:20.800 --> 35:23.260
You, get someone
to look after Commander Fu.

35:42.960 --> 35:44.840
What, afraid I'll run?

36:51.480 --> 36:52.190
Well?

36:52.590 --> 36:53.320
Is it her?

36:53.670 --> 36:54.280
Yes.

36:54.880 --> 36:56.190
So when do we strike?

36:56.510 --> 36:57.110
Not yet.

36:57.960 --> 36:59.560
We wait for the right moment.

37:03.840 --> 37:04.670
Your Highness,

37:04.670 --> 37:05.880
you can't go in!

37:35.880 --> 37:36.410
Brother.

37:38.760 --> 37:41.360
Greetings, Father.

37:49.000 --> 37:50.000
You lost the battle,

37:50.000 --> 37:51.440
instead of reflecting at home

37:51.440 --> 37:52.880
and waiting for my sommoning,

37:52.880 --> 37:55.550
you barged into the Chengde Hall.

37:56.150 --> 37:58.630
Today is my second brother's
coming-of-age ceremony.

37:58.630 --> 37:59.800
As his elder brother,

37:59.800 --> 38:00.730
if I didn't come,

38:00.840 --> 38:02.400
wouldn't

38:02.630 --> 38:03.880
people think

38:03.880 --> 38:05.360
we're at odds?

38:10.110 --> 38:11.630
Brother. You're back.

38:14.000 --> 38:15.630
Today isn't your birthday.

38:16.230 --> 38:17.480
Why hold

38:17.480 --> 38:18.610
the ceremony today?

38:19.800 --> 38:21.070
I don't know either.

38:21.190 --> 38:22.510
Mother chose the date.

38:22.670 --> 38:23.230
She said

38:23.280 --> 38:24.880
today's a good day,

38:25.070 --> 38:27.270
perfect for a coming-of-age ceremony.

38:27.670 --> 38:28.440
Fine.

38:29.110 --> 38:30.800
Second Brother doesn't know

38:30.920 --> 38:32.110
what today is.

38:32.960 --> 38:35.000
Father, do you not know either?

38:45.510 --> 38:46.400
Today

38:47.150 --> 38:49.800
is your second brother's coming-of-age.

38:50.070 --> 38:51.150
Then it's

38:51.760 --> 38:53.890
has been chosen quite unfortunately.

38:57.320 --> 38:58.360
I have to

38:58.550 --> 38:59.440
spoil

38:59.480 --> 39:00.340
this ceremony,

39:00.880 --> 39:02.940
but will make it up to you another day.

39:03.030 --> 39:03.630
Oh,

39:04.190 --> 39:05.440
I sent you a nice sword

39:05.440 --> 39:06.440
to your quarters.

39:07.000 --> 39:07.960
Go have a look.

39:08.590 --> 39:09.190
Really?

39:09.710 --> 39:10.710
Thanks, Brother!

39:11.400 --> 39:12.030
Father.

39:12.360 --> 39:13.070
Go on.

39:15.510 --> 39:16.370
I take my leave.

39:24.000 --> 39:25.000
Since you're here,

39:25.000 --> 39:25.840
explain,

39:26.280 --> 39:27.280
why did we lose

39:27.440 --> 39:28.770
the Battle of Pingling?

39:33.280 --> 39:34.110
Your Majesty,

39:34.400 --> 39:36.030
I suspect there's a spy

39:36.590 --> 39:38.120
within the Feng Battalion.

39:46.110 --> 39:47.760
What evidence do you have?

39:48.320 --> 39:50.150
On His Highness's retreat,

39:50.400 --> 39:51.590
he was ambushed multiple times.

39:51.590 --> 39:52.510
Had someone in the Feng Battalion

39:52.510 --> 39:54.070
not leaked the route,

39:54.110 --> 39:55.370
how could that happen?

39:55.630 --> 39:56.840
If there was

39:56.960 --> 39:58.230
a leak during retreat,

39:58.590 --> 40:00.120
then perhaps the siege plan

40:00.190 --> 40:02.150
was already betrayed

40:02.190 --> 40:03.450
to Jinxiu beforehand.

40:03.880 --> 40:06.320
I've already sent Zhuang He,
the city gate official,

40:06.320 --> 40:10.250
to take the Feng Battalion to the Ministry
of Justice for questioning.

40:11.230 --> 40:12.880
Do you have anything to say?

40:13.590 --> 40:14.630
I think

40:15.150 --> 40:16.630
what he says makes sense.

40:20.320 --> 40:22.000
However, I've already found

40:22.880 --> 40:24.550
the spy in the army.

40:27.670 --> 40:28.630
Your Majesty,

40:28.800 --> 40:31.660
Lu Ke from the Feng Battalion
requests an audience.

40:33.320 --> 40:34.320
Summon him.

40:52.550 --> 40:55.230
I'm subordinate Lu Ke.
Greetings, Your Majesty.

40:55.230 --> 40:56.490
You're wearing armor.

40:56.550 --> 40:57.950
No need for formalities.

40:58.510 --> 40:59.910
Thank you, Your Majesty!

41:00.030 --> 41:01.830
Show this to the Prime Minister.

41:02.000 --> 41:03.070
He might

41:03.440 --> 41:04.840
recognize this traitor.

41:11.320 --> 41:12.880
What's in the box?

41:13.710 --> 41:15.550
Your Highness, do speak plainly.

41:15.550 --> 41:17.000
No need for riddles

41:17.440 --> 41:18.570
before His Majesty.

41:19.030 --> 41:20.920
Since you don't wish to see it,

41:21.630 --> 41:24.070
perhaps Vice Minister of Justice,
Zhuang Ming,

41:24.070 --> 41:25.510
would be interested.

42:16.630 --> 42:19.880
It's... It's He...

42:21.630 --> 42:22.360
Yes.

42:22.630 --> 42:23.510
Inside

42:23.550 --> 42:26.440
is the severed head
of Zhuang He, the city gate official.

42:26.440 --> 42:27.670
He's the one who tried to assassinate me

42:27.670 --> 42:29.280
along the way.

42:29.760 --> 42:31.190
When I entered the city earlier,

42:31.190 --> 42:33.450
he confessed in person and was executed.

42:34.150 --> 42:35.400
He also claimed

42:36.030 --> 42:37.150
he acted

42:37.710 --> 42:39.840
alone.

42:44.760 --> 42:45.560
Your Majesty!

42:45.710 --> 42:47.510
This is only the First Prince's word.

42:47.510 --> 42:49.070
There's no proof.
On what grounds was He killed?

42:49.070 --> 42:51.670
I ask Your Majesty
to investigate thoroughly.

42:58.550 --> 43:00.280
What say you, Prime Minister?

43:01.840 --> 43:03.960
Did I have reason to kill him?
